{"id":"n15768-1-7","stage":4,"title":"민간 · 民间","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15768-1-7-1","ko":"커피가 원래 민간에 전해져 내려오던 약이었대.","zh":"据说咖啡原本是一种在民间流传下来的药材呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"커피가","meaning":"咖啡","explanation":"커피：咖啡；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"커피","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27372","senseId":"2","lemma":"커피","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"커피가","audio":"/audio/841acaba8cdda81d3281.mp3"}},{"text":"원래","meaning":"原来，本来","explanation":"원래：原来，本来","readings":[{"term":"원래","audio":"/audio/dc5331dd64d187d4a0fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53768","senseId":"1","lemma":"원래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"원래","audio":"/audio/dc5331dd64d187d4a0fd.mp3"}},{"text":"민간에","meaning":"民间","explanation":"민간：民间；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"민간","audio":"/audio/549c5f4865414b3a09bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15768","senseId":"1","lemma":"민간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민간에","audio":"/audio/a562a82a2803d90f7c29.mp3"}},{"text":"전해져","meaning":"流传；表示成为前面表达的那样。","explanation":"전하다：流传；지다：表示成为前面表达的那样。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"전하다","audio":"/audio/4adf4bd60c3c16263914.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75767","senseId":"1","lemma":"전하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"2","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전해져","audio":"/audio/a03a0458072a03676794.mp3"}},{"text":"내려오던","meaning":"传下来，流传，传承","explanation":"내려오다：传下来，流传，传承；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"내려오다","audio":"/audio/35192c2853ec6a6272bb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64559","senseId":"7","lemma":"내려오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내려오던","audio":"/audio/ee61fbf3c0b405e8cd1a.mp3"}},{"text":"약이었대.","meaning":"药","explanation":"약：药；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"약","audio":"/audio/2a9db5dfd1480367dc36.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72379","senseId":"1","lemma":"약","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"약이었대","audio":"/audio/8dd32353e6127251f7fe.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a4215a3126661d52","term":"커피","zh":"咖啡","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3","entryId":"27372","definition":"是一种用咖啡豆制作出来的、苦涩的深棕色饮品，其含有独特的香味及咖啡因。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"dc5331dd64d187d4","term":"원래","zh":"原来，本来","audio":"/audio/dc5331dd64d187d4a0fd.mp3","entryId":"53768","definition":"从一开始；或指从根本上。","pronunciation":["월래"]},{"id":"549c5f4865414b3a","term":"민간","zh":"民间","audio":"/audio/549c5f4865414b3a09bd.mp3","entryId":"15768","definition":"普通民众之间。","pronunciation":["민간"]},{"id":"4adf4bd60c3c1626","term":"전하다","zh":"流传","audio":"/audio/4adf4bd60c3c16263914.mp3","entryId":"75767","definition":"某物经过悠久岁月被传承或留存下来。","pronunciation":["전하다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的那样。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的那样。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"35192c2853ec6a62","term":"내려오다","zh":"传下来，流传，传承","audio":"/audio/35192c2853ec6a6272bb.mp3","entryId":"64559","definition":"从过去传到现在。","pronunciation":["내려오다"]},{"id":"2a9db5dfd1480367","term":"약","zh":"药","audio":"/audio/2a9db5dfd1480367dc36.mp3","entryId":"72379","definition":"为了治疗、预防病患或伤口，服用、抹、注射的物质。","pronunciation":["약"]}],"audio":"/audio/3eef46db6dc5d1a35a46.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15768-1-7-2","ko":"정말? 신기하다.","zh":"真的吗？真有意思。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말?","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"신기하다.","meaning":"新奇，神奇","explanation":"신기하다：新奇，神奇；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"신기하다","audio":"/audio/b97b3c0972748f91d896.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"13998","senseId":"1","lemma":"신기하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"신기하다","audio":"/audio/b97b3c0972748f91d896.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"b97b3c0972748f91","term":"신기하다","zh":"新奇，神奇","audio":"/audio/b97b3c0972748f91d896.mp3","entryId":"13998","definition":"由于第一次看见而感到新鲜奇特。","pronunciation":["신기하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/53d294646fc297903a4e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.771,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15768","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":134,"sequenceScore":2.5977,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["真的吗？真有意思。","据说咖啡原本是一种在民间流传下来的药材呢。","在教室里不要乱跑。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["据说咖啡原本是一种在民间流传下来的药材呢。","在教室里不要乱跑。","真的吗？真有意思。"],"answer":2}]}
